{
  "slug": "the-knock",
  "title": "The Knock (Part 1)",
  "timing": "estimated",
  "voice": null,
  "duration": 77.992,
  "shots": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "In this town, when the streetlights go out,",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.285,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.285
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "you never open the door.",
      "start": 3.285,
      "end": 5.209,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.924
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "That's when the Knockers come.",
      "start": 5.209,
      "end": 7.311,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.102
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "They sound like people you love.",
      "start": 7.311,
      "end": 9.665,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.354
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "Last year, one knocked on the Parkers' door using their grandma's voice.",
      "start": 9.665,
      "end": 14.4,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.735
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "Their grandma lives in Florida.",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 16.531,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.131
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "The rules are simple. Lock everything.",
      "start": 16.531,
      "end": 19.283,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.752
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "Don't answer.",
      "start": 19.283,
      "end": 20.304,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.021
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "Knockers can copy any voice, but only words they heard today.",
      "start": 20.304,
      "end": 24.55,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.246
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "Tonight, Mom and Dad went out for dinner.",
      "start": 24.55,
      "end": 27.626,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.076
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "\"Back before the lights go out,\" Mom said.",
      "start": 27.626,
      "end": 30.572,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.946
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "She kissed my head and called me \"bug,\" like she does every night.",
      "start": 30.572,
      "end": 35.193,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.621
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "We were on the front porch.",
      "start": 35.193,
      "end": 37.398,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.205
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "At nine, the streetlights went out.",
      "start": 37.398,
      "end": 39.911,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.513
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "They weren't home.",
      "start": 39.911,
      "end": 41.272,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.361
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "At nine-oh-one, someone knocked on the front door.",
      "start": 41.272,
      "end": 44.556,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.284
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "\"Bug? It's Mom. I lost my keys. Open up, it's freezing.\"",
      "start": 44.556,
      "end": 49.006,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.45
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "Then, a knock on the back door. Softer.",
      "start": 49.006,
      "end": 52.243,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.237
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "\"Hey, kiddo. It's Dad. Mom's with me. Don't open the front. Something followed us.\"",
      "start": 52.243,
      "end": 58.291,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 6.048
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "Dad never calls me kiddo.",
      "start": 58.291,
      "end": 60.244,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.953
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "But Mom said \"bug\" on the porch, where anything could have heard it.",
      "start": 60.244,
      "end": 65.024,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.78
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "The front door rattled.",
      "start": 65.024,
      "end": 66.726,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.702
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "The back door went quiet. Too quiet.",
      "start": 66.726,
      "end": 69.611,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.885
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "text": "My phone has two percent battery.",
      "start": 69.611,
      "end": 71.994,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.383
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "text": "I can reach one door before it dies.",
      "start": 71.994,
      "end": 74.852,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.858
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "text": "Front door, or back door?",
      "start": 74.852,
      "end": 77.992,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "1.8",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.14
    }
